OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FActor Nicholas Hoult has faced
OL,7,Fbacklash from some fans after it was
OL,8,Fannounced that he would join the cast
OL,9,Fof HBO's Harry Potter television
OL,10,Fseries.
OL,12,FHoult is set to play Harry Potter's
OL,13,Feccentric teacher, Gilderoy Lockhart,
OL,14,Fwho appears in the second novel and
OL,15,Fwas first played by veteran British
OL,16,Factor Kenneth Branagh.
OL,18,FHis participation in the show was met
OL,19,Fwith dismay by some fans, due to Harry
OL,20,FPotter author J.K. Rowling's views on
OL,21,Fgender.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
