PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FRowling has stated she believes
OL,7,Fbiological sex is real and immutable
OL,8,Fand has been critical of self-declared
OL,9,Fgender identity, calling it "quasi-
OL,10,Freligious" and "anti-science".
OL,12,FThe author has denied being
OL,13,Ftransphobic and previously said she
OL,14,Frespects "every trans person's right
OL,15,Fto live any way that feels authentic
OL,16,Fand comfortable to them".
OL,18,FRowling has also used her own money to
OL,19,Ffund legal cases seeking to prohibit
OL,20,Ftransgender people's access to single
OL,21,Fsex spaces.
OL,26,@qD@]OUrD@JO]rD@POUrD@]O]vD@JOUxD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/27
