OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FSupporters view these efforts as
OL,7,Fnecessary to protect the rights of
OL,8,Fbiological women, while those opposing
OL,9,Fthem see them as part of a wider anti-
OL,10,Ftrans movement.
OL,12,FRowling serves as an executive
OL,13,Fproducer on HBO's show, which is
OL,14,Fthought to be one of the most
OL,15,Fexpensively produced television series
OL,16,Fof all time.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
