OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FNicholas Hoult is the latest actor to
OL,7,Fface criticism for joining a Rowling
OL,8,Fproject, but who else is set to star
OL,9,Fin HBO's new show, and what have they
OL,10,Fsaid about the accompanying political
OL,11,Fdebate?
OL,13,FNicholas Hoult - Gilderoy Lockhart
OL,15,FHoult first appeared on screen in 1996
OL,16,Fas a child, and would go on to star in
OL,17,Fthe film About a Boy, the TV show
OL,18,FSkins, and more recently Superman, The
OL,19,FMenu, and X-Men.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
