OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FThe actor has previously revealed in
OL,7,Finterviews that he had unsuccessfully
OL,8,Fauditioned for the role of Harry
OL,9,FPotter and Draco Malfoy when the films
OL,10,Fwere first made.
OL,12,FReacting on X, some users expressed
OL,13,Fdismay at him joining the show,
OL,14,Fsharing sentiments such as: "This is
OL,15,Fdisappointing to see. It's a shame to
OL,16,Fsee him working on something that will
OL,17,Fbenefit anti-LGBT+ groups."
OL,26,@vD@]OUyD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/27
