OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FA fan account for the star,
OL,7,F@houltdaily, added: "Pausing any posts
OL,8,Fon this account for the time being.
OL,9,FNicholas Hoult, do better; so many of
OL,10,Fyour fans are hurt."
OL,12,FHoult has yet to address the issue
OL,13,Fpublicly. ITV News has reached out to
OL,14,Fhis representatives for comment.
OL,16,FBel Powley - Petunia Dursley
OL,18,FPowley rose to fame playing the lead
OL,19,Fcharacter in the 2015 film Diary of a
OL,20,FTeenage Girl, and has since appeared
OL,21,Fin multiple films and TV shows.
OL,26,@oD@UOUrD@TO]
