OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FSpeaking to the Telegraph earlier this
OL,7,Fweek, she distanced herself from
OL,8,FRowling's views, saying: "I strongly
OL,9,Fdisagree with J.K. Rowling's views on
OL,10,Fgender. I think that the trans
OL,11,Fcommunity deserve safety and dignity
OL,12,Fand respect and total acceptance."
OL,14,FShe continued: "But I love Harry
OL,15,FPotter. I grew up with the books. I am
OL,16,Ffrom that first generation of readers
OL,17,Fand, again, I love magic and
OL,18,Fspookiness."
OL,20,FJohn Lithgow - Albus Dumbledore
OL,26,@pD@ZOUtD@bO]vD@POUzD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/27
