OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FVeteran Hollywood actor John Lithgow
OL,7,Fhas recently appeared as Winston
OL,8,FChurchill in Netflix's The Crown,
OL,9,Fstarred in the TV show Dexter, and
OL,10,Falso voiced Lord Farquaad in the
OL,11,Fanimated film Shrek.
OL,13,FAfter accepting the role, Lithgow
OL,14,Fsaid: "It was not an easy decision
OL,15,Fbecause it's going to define me for
OL,16,Fthe last chapter of my life, I'm
OL,17,Fafraid, but I'm very excited."
OL,26,@yD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/27
