PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FSpeaking at a film festival in
OL,7,FRotterdam, Lithgow said he found it
OL,8,F"ironic and somewhat inexplicable"
OL,9,Fthat Rowling expressed the views she
OL,10,Fdid, saying he had "read about them".
OL,12,F"She's not really involved in this
OL,13,Fproduction at all," he said.
OL,15,F"The people who are re-adapting Harry
OL,16,FPotter and turning it into an eight-
OL,17,Fyear-long TV series are remarkable...
OL,18,FThese are people I really want to work
OL,19,Fwith."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
