PN,31410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FWhen Lithgow's role was announced, he
OL,7,Fclaimed a friend with a transgender
OL,8,Fchild sent him a link calling on him
OL,9,Fto walk away from the production.
OL,11,F"It was a hard decision," Lithgow
OL,12,Fsaid. "It made me uncomfortable and
OL,13,Funhappy that people insisted I walk
OL,14,Faway from the job. I chose not to do
OL,15,Fthat.
OL,17,F"It upsets me when people are
OL,18,Fvehemently opposed to me having
OL,19,Fanything to do with this," he added.
OL,21,FNick Frost - Hagrid
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@YO]tD@GOUyD@AOU{D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/27
