OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FBritish actor Nick Frost is widely
OL,7,Fknown for his roles in Shaun of the
OL,8,FDead, Hot Fuzz, and The World's End.
OL,10,FSpeaking to the Observer, Frost
OL,11,Frevealed he had had to turn off
OL,12,Fcomments on his social media posts
OL,13,Fannouncing his casting as a result of
OL,14,Fthe backlash.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
