PN,31412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FAsked if he feared the debate
OL,7,Fovershadowing the series, Frost said,
OL,8,F"I don't know," adding: "But maybe it
OL,9,Fshouldn't blow over? We shouldn't just
OL,10,Fhope it will go away, because it makes
OL,11,Fit easier. Maybe we should educate
OL,12,Fourselves.
OL,14,F"She's allowed her opinion, and I'm
OL,15,Fallowed mine; they just don't align in
OL,16,Fany way, shape or form."
OL,18,FKatherine Parkinson - Molly Weasley
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@OO]pD@YOUvD@AOUxD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/27
