OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FKatherine Parkinson rose to fame
OL,7,Fplaying Jen in Graham Lineham's The IT
OL,8,FCrowd, but has also starred in
OL,9,FSherlock and more recently, Disney's
OL,10,FRivals.
OL,12,FAsked by Radio Times how she felt
OL,13,Fabout J.K. Rowling's views as she
OL,14,Fjoined the show, Parkinson refused to
OL,15,Fdirectly comment, saying: "I don't
OL,16,Fwant to add to that debate at all. I'm
OL,17,Fjust delighted to be joining the
OL,18,Fmagical world of Harry Potter."
OL,20,FPaapa Essiedu - Severus Snape
OL,26,@wD@[OUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/27
