OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FBritish actor Paapa Essiedu began his
OL,7,Fcareer on stage, joining the Royal
OL,8,FShakespeare Company in 2012. He went
OL,9,Fon to star on screen, appearing in
OL,10,Fnumerous TV shows including Black
OL,11,FMirror, I May Destroy You, and Gangs
OL,12,Fof London.
OL,14,FHis casting as Hogwarts' potions
OL,15,Fprofessor Severus Snape, previously
OL,16,Fplayed by Alan Rickman in the original
OL,17,Ffilms, saw some criticise the decision
OL,18,Fon account of his race.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
