PN,31415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FEssiedu revealed in an interview with
OL,7,Fthe Times that he had received death
OL,8,Fthreats in response to the
OL,9,Fannouncement, but admitted the abuse
OL,10,Ffuelled him.
OL,12,F"I think of how I felt as a kid. I
OL,13,Fwould imagine myself at Hogwarts on
OL,14,Fbroomsticks, and the idea that a kid
OL,15,Flike me can see themselves represented
OL,16,Fin that world? That's motivation to
OL,17,Fnot be intimidated by someone saying
OL,18,Fthey'd rather I died instead of doing
OL,19,Fwork I'm going to be really proud of."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31416
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FIn the wake of 2025's Supreme Court
OL,7,Fruling on gender and single sex
OL,8,Fspaces, Essiedu signed an open letter
OL,9,Fsupporting trans rights in the UK.
OL,11,FAt the time, there was speculation he
OL,12,Frisked his role in the show by doing
OL,13,Fso, to which Rowling responded by
OL,14,Fwriting on social media: "I don't have
OL,15,Fthe power to sack an actor from the
OL,16,Fseries, and I wouldn't exercise it if
OL,17,FI did. I don't believe in taking away
OL,18,Fpeople's jobs or livelihoods because
OL,19,Fthey hold legally protected beliefs
OL,20,Fthat differ from mine."
OL,26,@vD@ZOU|D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31417
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FAddressing the letter, Essiedu said:
OL,7,F"My points of view are mine and will
OL,8,Fcontinue to be so.
OL,10,F"I signed that letter because I
OL,11,Fbelieve that artists in the trans
OL,12,Fcommunity have a right to be treated
OL,13,Fwith dignity and should be able to
OL,14,Fwork without being intimidated. I have
OL,15,Fbeen really supported by the
OL,16,Fproduction team, and I'd sign that
OL,17,Fletter again today."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
