OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FActors appearing in the upcoming TV
OL,7,Fshow aren't the only ones facing
OL,8,Fbacklash for involvement in a Harry
OL,9,FPotter project.
OL,11,FThe recent release of a voice-acted
OL,12,Faudiobook series of all the Potter
OL,13,Fnovels saw a slew of famous actors
OL,14,Fissue statements on their casting.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31419
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FKeira Knightley, who was cast as
OL,7,FDolores Umbridge, told interviewers
OL,8,Fshe was "not aware" of the controversy
OL,9,Fbefore joining the audiobooks, adding:
OL,10,F"I think we're all living in a period
OL,11,Fof time right now where we're all
OL,12,Fgoing to have to figure out how to
OL,13,Flive together, aren't we? And we've
OL,14,Fall got very different opinions. I
OL,15,Fhope that we can all find respect."
OL,26,@wD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31420
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FScottish actress Michelle Gomez, who
OL,7,Fwas cast as Professor McGonagall and
OL,8,Fis known for a series of roles
OL,9,Fincluding Missy in Doctor Who, issued
OL,10,Fa statement directly to her LGBTQ+
OL,11,Ffans.
OL,13,FShe wrote: "To my LGBTQ+ fans, and
OL,14,Fespecially the trans community: I want
OL,15,Fto speak directly to the concerns that
OL,16,Fhave been raised about my involvement
OL,17,Fin this project.
OL,26,@uD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G20/27
