OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,F"I hear you, and I understand why this
OL,7,Fis painful for many. I want to be
OL,8,Fclear that I stand with trans people,
OL,9,Fand I support trans rights - fully and
OL,10,Fwithout hesitation.
OL,12,F"When I accepted this role, I did so
OL,13,Fas someone who has always loved the
OL,14,Fstories and what they meant to so many
OL,15,F` especially those who found comfort
OL,16,Fand identity in that world.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G21/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31422
SC,0022
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,F"I now understand more clearly how
OL,7,Fdeeply complicated and hurtful this
OL,8,Fassociation can feel, and I take that
OL,9,Fseriously. Being an ally means
OL,10,Flistening even when it's uncomfortable
OL,11,Fand taking accountability where it's
OL,12,Fneeded. I'm committed to doing both."
OL,14,FActors James McAvoy, Hugh Laurie, and
OL,15,FKit Harington also voiced roles in the
OL,16,Faudiobooks but did not issue public
OL,17,Fstatements on Rowling's or their own
OL,18,Fviews.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@eO]
