OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FRowling has previously addressed her
OL,7,Frelationship with former Harry Potter
OL,8,Fstars who have distanced themselves
OL,9,Ffrom her views on gender.
OL,11,FDaniel Radcliffe, who originally
OL,12,Fplayed the titular role and has
OL,13,Fhimself ruled out ever returning to
OL,14,Fthe franchise, described his public
OL,15,Frift with Rowling as "really sad".
OL,17,FIn a public statement: "Transgender
OL,18,Fwomen are women. Any statement to the
OL,19,Fcontrary erases the identity and
OL,20,Fdignity of transgender people."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G23/27
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
