PN,31424
SC,0024
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FHermione Granger actor Emma Watson,
OL,7,Fand Ron Weasley actor Rupert Grint
OL,8,Fhave also made public statements to
OL,9,Fthe same effect.
OL,11,FResponding on social media in 2025,
OL,12,FJ.K. Rowling said: "I'm not owed
OL,13,Feternal agreement from any actor who
OL,14,Fonce played a character I created. The
OL,15,Fidea is as ludicrous as me checking
OL,16,Fwith the boss I had when I was twenty-
OL,17,Fone for what opinions I should hold
OL,18,Fthese days.
OL,26,@tD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G24/27
