OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786817921
OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,F"Emma Watson and her co-stars have
OL,7,Fevery right to embrace gender identity
OL,8,Fideology. Such beliefs are legally
OL,9,Fprotected, and I wouldn't want to see
OL,10,Fany of them threatened with loss of
OL,11,Fwork, or violence, or death, because
OL,12,Fof them."
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,19,FNot all of the original cast have
OL,20,Fsought to distance themselves, however.
