OL,3,CNicholas Hoult latest to face backlash
OL,4,Cover role in new Harry Potter TV series
OL,6,FDraco Malfoy actor Tom Felton, who
OL,7,Freturned to the same role in the stage
OL,8,Fplay Harry Potter and the Cursed Child
OL,9,Fin New York in 2025, said when asked:
OL,10,F"I can't say it (impacts me), I'm not
OL,11,Freally that attuned to it."
OL,13,FHe added: "I have not seen anything
OL,14,Fbring the world together more than
OL,15,FPotter. She's responsible for that, so
OL,16,FI'm incredibly grateful."
